(7303779, 1139376, 83149, '<td valign="top">Great idea, but there are a few details you overlooked that would have made this a great shot.  The pencil is not sharpened, the print is obviously not hand written and writing surface is pretty dirty.</td>', 'Great idea, but there are a few details you overlooked that would have made this a great shot.  The pencil is not sharpened, the print is obviously not hand written and writing surface is pretty dirty.', '2015-01-18 15:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
