(7304360, 1139295, 156466, '<td valign="top">(I''m harping on this with everyone whose shot I like, but since you couldn''t correct it) If only the door was perfectly vertical.</td>', '(I''m harping on this with everyone whose shot I like, but since you couldn''t correct it) If only the door was perfectly vertical.', '2015-01-20 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
