(7304862, 1139337, 159196, '<td valign="top">Well done - it as the only image in which the ghost is a smoky, flowing image. It works really well.</td>', 'Well done - it as the only image in which the ghost is a smoky, flowing image. It works really well.', '2015-01-21 03:29:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(7304866, 1139253, 163430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timb:</b></div><hr/><i> Cute shot. I would like to see this with all of the characters being in focus.  I like the smoking hill though. Nice capture. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I tried one with all of the characters OUT OF focus. Didn''t like it :-)<br/> <br/>On your original remark. It would be and interesting shot but very difficult. The aperture used is already f/11 and the minions are way out of focus. Raising up the ISO to 800 (usable on D3200) would give f/32 which may or may not bring them in focus but will surely introduce diffraction. Using a shorter lens might help, but i opted for a telephoto to compress the perspective.<br/> <br/>Focus stacking is another option but can''t be used in minimal editing. Even if legal, it would be very difficult to execute with the smoke around.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by timb: Cute shot. I would like to see this with all of the characters being in focus.  I like the smoking hill though. Nice capture.   I tried one with all of the characters OUT OF focus. Didn''t like it :-) On your original remark. It would be and interesting shot but very difficult. The aperture used is already f/11 and the minions are way out of focus. Raising up the ISO to 800 (usable on D3200) would give f/32 which may or may not bring them in focus but will surely introduce diffraction. Using a shorter lens might help, but i opted for a telephoto to compress the perspective. Focus stacking is another option but can''t be used in minimal editing. Even if legal, it would be very difficult to execute with the smoke around.', '2015-01-21 03:42:07.000000', NULL, 0),
